      "cooked": "<p>Hello,</p><p>I took 6 different achievement lists and compiled them with some tweaks.&nbsp; My playing group up here in Alaska will be running a league off of this list this winter.&nbsp; Credits for the original lists are at the bottom of the document.&nbsp; The new checklists just released have been added! Hopefully somebody out there likes it!&nbsp; Enjoy!</p><p>1-23-15- Added the coverpage for our basic guideline rules for the league we will be running for the next few months- created by Ryan Catron.</p>\n<p><a class=\"attachment\" href=\"/uploads/short-url/x87lI22gxJhhDZWAf1FhJKm2suw.pdf\">SOTMChecklist.pdf</a> (216 KB)</p>\n<p><a class=\"attachment\" href=\"/uploads/short-url/nsGTjioIHSDttr4MBpe5iX2HTcZ.pdf\">League Rules for sentinels.pdf</a> (280 KB)</p>",
